@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-login-accessToken
@orderId = replace-with-order-id
@idempotencyKey = create-order-001

### Login (credentials injected through bootstrap environment)
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{customerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{customerPassword}}"
}

### Current identity
GET {{gateway}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create an order; customer identity comes only from the token
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{
  "productId": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Owned orders (ADMIN sees all)
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Order and timeline
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ADMIN stock
GET {{gateway}}/api/inventory?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ADMIN notification history
GET {{gateway}}/api/notifications?orderId={{orderId}}&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel an owned CONFIRMED order (no request body)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: cancel-order-001

### Revoke this token
POST {{gateway}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
